# Parcels

> Parcels is a global package-tracking service. AI assistants may read public pages and use the free, rate-limited Remote MCP tracking service described below.

## Free tracking for AI assistants

- Remote MCP (Streamable HTTP): https://parcelsapp.com/mcp
- MCP guide: https://parcelsapp.com/mcp.md
- Tools: `track_shipment` and `get_tracking_result`
- Authentication: no API key for the public MCP service
- Limits: cached results are served first; anonymous clients may start 1 unique live tracking number per hour; verified provider infrastructure may start up to 1,000 unique live tracking numbers per hour
- Full text: https://parcelsapp.com/llms-full.txt

The MCP tool contract is returned by MCP tool discovery. Provider IP ranges and User-Agent values are used only to choose a quota tier; they are not account authentication.

## Parcels API v4 for developers

- API documentation: https://parcelsapp.com/api-docs
- OpenAPI: https://parcelsapp.com/api-docs/openapi.json
- API-focused LLM text: https://parcelsapp.com/api-docs/llms.txt
- Mock API: https://parcelsapp.com/api-docs/mock/v4
- Live API base: https://parcelsapp.com/api/v4

The developer API v4 is a separate authenticated product. Public MCP access does not make the general API free or remove its API-key requirements.

